# ctrim_app models

- Plain Dart in `lib/models/`; avoid Flutter imports unless necessary (`EventHead` uses `Color`/`TimeOfDay`)
- Constructor with named params and defaults
- `fromMap(String id, Map<String, dynamic> data)` for Firestore/Hive
- `toJson()` → `Map<String, dynamic>`
- Private `_` fields; public getters/setters
- List getters return `UnmodifiableListView`
- `Timestamp` from `cloud_firestore`; convert to/from `DateTime` inside the model

Note: testimonial model file is `lib/models/info/testimonial_into.dart` (historical typo — do not rename without a dedicated refactor).

When adding or changing a model, add/update `test/unit/models/<name>_test.dart`.
